open MvPowerSeries GlobalTheory GlobalTheory.Katz GlobalTheory.QLog GlobalTheory.PDivGroup GlobalTheory.Sandwich GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.EpsilonPairingZeta GlobalTheory.PDivLat

